*
* START-DESCRIPTION:
*
* SET.TRIGGER file.name trigger.name {modes}   Set to given name and modes
* SET.TRIGGER file.name ""                     Remove trigger function
* SET.TRIGGER file.name                        Display trigger function name
*
* END-DESCRIPTION
